WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.927
Quality vs. Speed.

2
00:00:01.927 --> 00:00:04.319
You are behind schedule, but skipping a quality

3
00:00:04.319 --> 00:00:07.372
check would help you finish on time. What do you do?

4
00:00:07.372 --> 00:00:08.173
A...

5
00:00:08.173 --> 00:00:11.993
Skip the check; meeting the deadline matters most. B...

6
00:00:12.597 --> 00:00:15.221
Repeat every check twice even if

7
00:00:15.221 --> 00:00:18.332
it creates a major delay. C...

8
00:00:18.332 --> 00:00:21.095
Complete the required quality check and communicate

9
00:00:21.095 --> 00:00:24.044
early if the deadline is at risk. D...

10
00:00:24.044 --> 00:00:26.982
Ask a coworker to sign off without reviewing it.
